# Cloudflare Pages redirects -- counterpart of vercel.json. Two rules (at the end): the short
# addresses of the TV app's APKs, typed with a remote into the Downloader app. No others, because:
#
# - cleanUrls: Pages already serves /guide from guide.html and /mac from mac.html, and
#   308-redirects /guide.html -> /guide and /index.html -> / on its own (its default
#   "pretty URLs" behaviour), so vercel.json's "cleanUrls": true needs no rule here.
#   Difference: Pages also redirects a trailing slash (/guide/ -> /guide).
# - leonida-sub-th-app.vercel.app -> www.leonidasubth.com stays in vercel.json only: requests
#   for the vercel.app host never reach Cloudflare. (_redirects cannot match hosts anyway.)
# - apex leonidasubth.com -> www: a Cloudflare dashboard Redirect Rule, not this file
#   (see docs/cloudflare-pages.md).
# - unknown pages get 404.html with status 404 (without a top-level 404.html Pages would
#   behave like an SPA and answer every unknown path with index.html + 200).

/tv.apk https://github.com/bookbang285/leonida-sub-th-app/releases/download/tv-latest/LeonidaSubTV.apk 302
/tv2.apk https://github.com/bookbang285/leonida-sub-th-app/releases/download/tv-latest/LeonidaSubTV-legacy.apk 302
